<title>FINLAND: Cultor sees 1997 profit near 1995 level.</title>
<headline>Cultor sees 1997 profit near 1995 level.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, animal feed and bakery group Cultor Oy on Wednesday repeated an earlier forecast its full-year 1997 earnings would be close to the 1995 level, when it made a 491 million markka profit after financial items.</p>
<p>&quot;We estimate the group's full-year 1997 profit for the period, excluding extraordinary items, to be close to that achieved in 1995,&quot; the company said in a statement with its January-April results.</p>
<p>Cultor's 1995 earnings per share were 14.91 markka.</p>
